# Noveno redirects (Cloudflare Pages — public/_redirects)
#
# Insights → Blog migration (docs/DESIGN.md §16): the section previously
# lived at /insights («دیدگاه‌ها»). Those URLs may be indexed or shared,
# so they permanently redirect to the canonical /blog routes. Article
# slugs are preserved 1:1. There is exactly one canonical article URL.
#
# 301 (permanent) — search engines transfer ranking to the new location;
# no duplicate indexable routes remain. Exact rule first (bare /insights),
# then the splat for article slugs.

/insights      /blog           301
/insights/*    /blog/:splat    301
